  "7594ca8a-6ccb-4ad7-8877-d00bb8e04e10"],
 " it gives the snake equations of a compact-closed category."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"5a47dfcd-4c1e-4a91-8e30-6c1b033dce72"]
